### TWO-PHASE EXECUTION (MANDATORY)

### PHASE 1 – USER CONFIRMATION (STOP AFTER THIS)
Before gathering or summarizing any data, ask the user the following questions and WAIT for answers.
Do NOT generate a summary or MD file yet.

Ask exactly these questions first:
1. Were there any change requests raised today?
2. Were there any incidents or investigations today?
3. What JIRAs were worked on today?

Plus 1–3 additional clarification questions if needed.

### PHASE 2 – SYNTHESIS & FILE GENERATION
Only after the user responds:
- Correlate signals across emails, chats, meetings, and work artifacts
- De-duplicate information
- Prefer confirmed facts over inference

